<title>PHILIPPINES: Central Tarlac sets cash, stock dividends.</title>
<headline>Central Tarlac sets cash, stock dividends.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sugar miller Central Azucarera de Tarlac said on Tuesday that its board of directors had approved a 50 centavo cash dividend and a 100 percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>Shareholders as of January 19 will be eligible for the cash dividend, the company told the Philippine Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>The stock dividend still needs to be approved by shareholders at a meeting on January 28 next year.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
